@!internal
module nupp.digest.internal.constants

--[[Fixed constants for the incremental digest word implementations.

Tables encode the standardized initial states, rotations, and round constants
used by the private digest algorithms. They are shared immutable implementation
data within one Lua state and contain no provider selection or mutable digest
state. Callers must not mutate these tables.
]]

-- SHA-512 words are high/low pairs: fractional square roots (initial state)
-- and cube roots (round constants) of the first primes, as specified in RFC 6234.
-- MD5 constants are floor(2^32 * abs(sin(i))), as specified in RFC 1321.

